TI  - Teaching Paper: Volunteer Recognition Certificate
PY  - 2025
DO  - 10.64357/neya-vrc-2025
AB  - This Teaching Paper introduces a Volunteer Recognition Certificate template as a formal method of acknowledging volunteer contributions. Grounded in motivational theory and non-profit management practice, it emphasizes recognition as both a symbolic and strategic retention tool. Certificates build identity, strengthen loyalty, and provide volunteers with tangible proof of their impact, while also signaling accountability to stakeholders.
